<!-- SEO content -->
<section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-10">

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Professional film narrator - the key to authentic storytelling</h2>
      <p>A professional film voice artist is more than someone who reads a script. It's a voice that sets the right tone for the production, amplifies emotions and ensures authenticity. In documentaries, educational, corporate or promotional videos, film narrators are indispensable - their vocal timbre, style and intonation have a tremendous impact on how the audience perceives the content.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How to choose the right voice for your video?</h3>
      <p>The right voice depends on many factors - the video's topic, target audience, and even the language and culture of the market. In our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a> you'll find both Polish narrators and international voice artists available in many languages. The voice should complement the visuals and create a cohesive, engaging narrative. If in doubt, our experts will help you make the right choice.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Professional recording studio - guaranteed top quality</h3>
      <p>Working with our studio gives you access to professional voiceover services and modern technical facilities. We produce recordings in broadcast standard - ready for television, online or any other medium. Every recording is made in controlled acoustic conditions with attention to detail and authenticity. We also offer full post-production, so the final result is perfectly tailored to your project's needs.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How much does professional film voiceover cost?</h3>
      <p>The price depends on several factors: material length, recording language, licence scope and required turnaround time. If you'd like to know the cost for your project - <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:underline">contact us</a> and we'll prepare a personalised quote. The fee covers not only the voice artist, but also the sound engineer's work, editing and mastering in our professional studio.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

